#. type: Plain text
#: data/man/l10n-lint.1:10
msgid ""
"B<l10n-lint> is a linter and validator for translation files "
"(.po, .ts, .xliff). It checks for missing translations, fuzzy entries, "
"placeholder mismatches, typography issues, HTML tag validation, keyboard "
"accelerator mismatches, and quality problems. Available as both CLI and GTK4/"
"Adwaita GUI. Supports GitHub repo scanning without cloning and localized "
"output in 45+ languages."
msgstr ""

